From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:26:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(05-04): context blocks with chunk ids, labeler hook
 and referenced sections

- ContextBlock, CitationLabeler, RetrievalResult.blocks, RunRetrievalInput.citationLabeler
- buildContext builds the block list while it renders and applies the labeler only when given;
  without a labeler the rendered context is unchanged
- resolveDocumentRefs returns sections; renderReferencedSection is the single section format
- legacy pipeline passes the labeler into the assemble stage and copies blocks into the result

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
